    "en": "Both English and Korean theory parts provide 75-page and 79-page question papers and separate two-page official T/F keys. Every file includes the original licence page. The final answer page is separated from each English question paper; the original 76-/80-page combined booklets remain linked as sources. Worked explanations and separate official blank answer sheets are not supplied by these sources."
